    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/974d200f00ab12b2d450cfda18ff53d1.poster.avif?t=1753467192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/974d200f00ab12b2d450cfda18ff53d1.webm?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/974d200f00ab12b2d450cfda18ff53d1.mp4?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/c3206a851e8a653a85a84263fa466e36.poster.avif?t=1753467192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/c3206a851e8a653a85a84263fa466e36.webm?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/c3206a851e8a653a85a84263fa466e36.mp4?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Age Legends</strong> is a game with turn-based combat mechanics where strategic decisions are essential, not only during battles but throughout your journey. Along the way, you\u2019ll need to choose the most righteous path and recruit the most suitable champions for your team. Unlock new abilities for these champions and transform them into legends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR TEAM!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies encountered may appear in large groups or huge monsters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is dangerous to travel alone!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/9ecda9ad6d1a7f78ca55c6b7eddbba69.poster.avif?t=1753467192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/9ecda9ad6d1a7f78ca55c6b7eddbba69.webm?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/9ecda9ad6d1a7f78ca55c6b7eddbba69.mp4?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR CHOICES CAREFULLY!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right team, the right equipment, the right choices, and the right strategy are crucial on the road to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has unique skills and a distinct play-style, some can be very strong in the right role and right team. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft special equipment with materials looted from the enemies you encounter on the path you choose and be fully equipped to fight big bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A battle strategy must be determined at the beginning of the road, long before the battle begins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/eb2de7c4dba9844213d944999a46e9bf.poster.avif?t=1753467192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/eb2de7c4dba9844213d944999a46e9bf.webm?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/eb2de7c4dba9844213d944999a46e9bf.mp4?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/974d200f00ab12b2d450cfda18ff53d1.poster.avif?t=1753467192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/974d200f00ab12b2d450cfda18ff53d1.webm?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/974d200f00ab12b2d450cfda18ff53d1.mp4?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/c3206a851e8a653a85a84263fa466e36.poster.avif?t=1753467192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/c3206a851e8a653a85a84263fa466e36.webm?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/c3206a851e8a653a85a84263fa466e36.mp4?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Age Legends</strong> is a game with turn-based combat mechanics where strategic decisions are essential, not only during battles but throughout your journey. Along the way, you\u2019ll need to choose the most righteous path and recruit the most suitable champions for your team. Unlock new abilities for these champions and transform them into legends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR TEAM!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies encountered may appear in large groups or huge monsters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is dangerous to travel alone!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/9ecda9ad6d1a7f78ca55c6b7eddbba69.poster.avif?t=1753467192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/9ecda9ad6d1a7f78ca55c6b7eddbba69.webm?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/9ecda9ad6d1a7f78ca55c6b7eddbba69.mp4?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR CHOICES CAREFULLY!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right team, the right equipment, the right choices, and the right strategy are crucial on the road to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has unique skills and a distinct play-style, some can be very strong in the right role and right team. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft special equipment with materials looted from the enemies you encounter on the path you choose and be fully equipped to fight big bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A battle strategy must be determined at the beginning of the road, long before the battle begins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/eb2de7c4dba9844213d944999a46e9bf.poster.avif?t=1753467192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/eb2de7c4dba9844213d944999a46e9bf.webm?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350630/extras/eb2de7c4dba9844213d944999a46e9bf.mp4?t=1753467192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
